{{Term/Store|Attack Up||Series, BotW, TotK}} is a recurring [[Added Effect]] in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref>{{Cite Guide|BotW Piggyback|edition= Expanded Edition|year= 2018|page= 280}}</ref><ref>{{Cite Guide|TotK Piggyback|page=402-403}}</ref>

==Overview==
Attack Up is an [[Added Effect]] that increases [[Link]]'s attack power by 20%, 30% and 50% for levels one, two and three respectively. It has a maximum potency of level three.

==={{BotW|-}}===
In {{BotW}}, the following [[Material]]s and [[Armor]] pieces grant Attack Up:

{{Data Table
|game= BotW
|sortable= false
|columns= Materials [IconList], Armor Pieces [IconList]
|-
| Mighty Bananas, Razorshroom, Mighty Thistle, Mighty Carp, Mighty Porgy, Razorclaw Crab, Bladed Rhino Beetle
| Barbarian Helm, Barbarian Armor, Barbarian Leg Wraps, Phantom Helmet, Phantom Armor, Phantom Greaves, Fierce Deity Mask, Fierce Deity Armor, Fierce Deity Boots
}}

==={{TotK|-}}===
In {{TotK}}, the Attack Up Effect now applies twice multiplicatively to thrown [[Weapon]]s. This means that with a level three Attack Up Effect active, instead of a thrown Weapon dealing 1.5x damage against [[Enemy|Enemies]], it will deal 2.25x damage.{{Exp|It is likely that this behavior is an unintended side effect of other changes made in {{TotK|-}}.}}

